WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.480
A note to all SCP Foundation staff: If Dr. Bright&nbsp;
has to ask, it's above his clearance level.&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.760
If it's above Bright's security clearance… run.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.240
Dr. Bright is one of the SCP Foundation’s&nbsp;
most illustrious researchers, and as site&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.120
director of Site-19, there’s very little under&nbsp;
the Foundation's purview that he can’t do.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.400
So if you find Dr. Bright is poking his stolen&nbsp;
nose where it shouldn’t be, then believe me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.560
you definitely shouldn’t be there. Think of&nbsp;
all the terrifying entities you know about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:35.760
from the SCP Foundation files. Now imagine all&nbsp;
the horrifying things you DON’T know about…

